  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Acceleration produced by electric field,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>a</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></math></p><p>After time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>, velocity of the particle,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>t</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>+</mo><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mover><mi>i</mi><mo>^</mo></mover><mo>&#160;</mo><mfenced open=\"[\" close=\"]\"><mrow><mo>&#8757;</mo><mi>u</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mover><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mo>^</mo></mover></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>So, speed of the particle,<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>v</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p>Now, given <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\"><mi>v</mi></mfenced><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></math>after time <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi></math>, so<br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>2</mn><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msqrt><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></msqrt></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>4</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>+</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>3</mn><msubsup><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn><mn>2</mn></msubsup><mo>=</mo><msup><mfenced><mfrac><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub><mi>t</mi></mrow><mi>m</mi></mfrac></mfenced><mn>2</mn></msup></math></p><p>So, time interval, <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msqrt><mn>3</mn></msqrt><mi>m</mi><msub><mi>v</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow><mrow><mi>q</mi><msub><mi>E</mi><mn>0</mn></msub></mrow></mfrac></math></p><p>Here, we must note that no change in magnitude of velocity is caused by a perpendicular magnetic field. So, we are not taking effect of magnetic field while calculating change in speed.</p>",
